{"speciesId":159,"names":{"fr":"Crocrodil","es":"Croconaw","en":"Croconaw","ja":"アリゲイツ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It opens its huge jaws wide when attacking. If it loses any fangs while biting, they grow back in."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The tips of its fangs are slanted backward. Once those fangs clamp down, the prey has no hope of escape."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Once CROCONAW has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"Once CROCONAW has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like fishhooks, they become irremovably embedded."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It opens its huge jaws wide when attacking. If it loses any fangs while biting, they grow back in."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It opens its huge jaws wide when attacking. If it loses any fangs while biting, they grow back in."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il mord, il ne lâche pas prise avant que ses crocs se brisent. Ils repoussent par la suite."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand il mord, il ne lâche pas prise avant que ses crocs se brisent. Ils repoussent par la suite."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Quand il perd un croc, il en repousse un autre. Sa bouche est en permanence composée de 48 dents."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Si pierde un colmillo, le crecerá otro en su lugar. Siempre tiene 48 colmillos en su boca."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"If it loses a fang, a new one grows back in its place. There are always 48 fangs lining its mouth."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"キバは 抜けても 次から 次に 生えてくる。いつも 口の中には ４８本の キバが そろっている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il mord, il ne lâche pas prise avant que ses crocs se brisent. Ils repoussent par la suite."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando muerde algo, no lo suelta hasta que pierde sus colmillos. Estos se regeneran rápidamente."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Once it bites down, it won’t let go until it loses its fangs. New fangs quickly grow into place."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"一度 かみつくと キバが 抜けるまで 絶対に 離さない。 抜けた キバは すぐに 生えてくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Une fois que Crocrodil a refermé sa mâchoire sur son ennemi, il est impossible de le faire lâcher prise. Ses crocs sont recourbés comme des hameçons et ne peuvent pas être retirés une fois enfoncés."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Una vez que Croconaw le ha clavado los colmillos a su presa, es imposible que escape porque los tiene hacia adentro como si fueran anzuelos. Cuando Croconaw hinca los dientes, no hay escapatoria."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Once Croconaw has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"一度 かみついたら 絶対に 離さない。 キバの 先が 釣り針 みたいに 反り返って いるので 一度 刺さると 抜けなく なるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Une fois que Crocrodil a refermé sa mâchoire sur son ennemi, il est impossible de le faire lâcher prise. Ses crocs sont recourbés comme des hameçons et ne peuvent pas être retirés une fois enfoncés."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Una vez que Croconaw le ha clavado los colmillos a su presa, es imposible que escape porque los tiene hacia adentro como si fueran anzuelos. Cuando Croconaw hinca los dientes, no hay escapatoria."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Once Croconaw has clamped its jaws on its foe, it will absolutely not let go. Because the tips of its fangs are forked back like barbed fishhooks, they become impossible to remove when they have sunk in."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"一度 かみついたら 絶対に 離さない。 キバの 先が 釣り針 みたいに 反り返って いるので 一度 刺さると 抜けなく なるのだ。"}],"varieties":[{"id":159,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch"